<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech buys Crawford schools.</title>
<headline>Advtech buys Crawford schools.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Technical Systems Ltd said on Wednesday it had agreed to acquire Crawford Education Group from Graeme Crawford and LeisureNet Ltd, effective retrospectively from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Advtech will issue 34 million &quot;N&quot; shares at 500 cents each in consideration of the acquisition.</p>
<p>The company added that negotiations were in progresss regarding further transactions.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
